.Dd August 14, 2026
.Dt FILEES-CLIENT-ENTRY 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm filees-client-entry
.Nd FileES per-key dispatcher for svnserve and control-plane tickets
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the set-id dispatcher installed for installation-key sessions.
.Xr sshd 8
selects the account
.Pq Sy _filees-client
or
.Sy _filees-data
and the per-key
.Ic command=
line.
.Nm
accepts exactly two original commands:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm svnserve -t
Tunnel-mode Subversion.
.It Cm filees control-v1
One authenticated control-plane ticket, then
.Xr filees-worker 8 .
.El
.Pp
Before a control-plane ticket it runs
.Xr filees-service-wc-corrector 8
so a previous root-owned administrative
.Nm svn
cannot leave the service working copy unreadable to
.Sy _filees-state .
.Pp
The image is
.Sy _filees-state : _filees-access
mode 4550.
It is not a general shell.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr filees-worker 8 ,
.Xr filees-service-wc-corrector 8
